---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Mental Wellness & Relationship Services (MWRS)"
  description="Learn how Mental Wellness & Relationship Services (MWRS) collects, protects, and uses personal information for counseling, telehealth, and medication management services."
>
  <main class="privacy-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="subpage-hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how Mental Wellness &amp; Relationship
          Services (MWRS) collects, uses, and protects your information when
          you visit our website or contact our team. Your privacy matters, and
          we are committed to handling your information responsibly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content -->
    <section class="privacy-body">
      <div class="section-inner">

        <p class="policy-effective">Effective date: March 28, 2026</p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          We collect information that you voluntarily provide when you fill out
          forms on our website — such as your name, email address, phone number,
          and date of birth. We may also receive basic technical data such as
          your browser type, device information, and anonymized website
          analytics through tools like Google Analytics.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <p>
          Information submitted through our website is used solely to respond
          to your inquiry and provide the services you have requested. We do not
          sell or share your personal information with third parties for
          marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>How your information is protected</h2>
        <p>
          MWRS uses secure systems, access controls, and administrative
          safeguards to help protect your information. Only authorized staff
          members involved in scheduling or care coordination have access to
          form submissions.
        </p>

        <h2>HIPAA and clinical information</h2>
        <p>
          If you become a client, your clinical records are maintained in
          SimplePractice, our HIPAA-compliant practice management system.
          SimplePractice operates under a Business Associate Agreement (BAA)
          and is subject to all applicable federal and state health information
          privacy regulations. Clinical information is separate from the
          general website data described in this policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          Our website uses the following third-party services that may receive
          limited data as part of their normal operation:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Formspree</strong> — processes form submissions (intake,
            billing questions, refill requests, and contact forms) and delivers
            them securely to our team. Formspree does not use your data for
            advertising.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics</strong> — provides anonymized traffic
            data such as page views and session duration. No personally
            identifying information is shared with Google Analytics.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Maps</strong> — used to display our office locations.
            Viewing the map may transmit your IP address to Google.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These services do not give us access to your private messages or
          clinical records unless you explicitly provide that information
          through a form.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may use cookies or similar technologies to support basic
          functionality and analytics. We do not use cookies for advertising or
          behavioral tracking. You may disable cookies in your browser settings,
          though this may affect how some parts of the site function.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You may contact us at any time to request updates or corrections to
          your information. If you prefer not to submit information through the
          website, you may call our office directly at
          <a href="tel:2082612255">208.261.2255</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Updates to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Any changes will be
          posted on this page with an updated effective date. Continued use of
          our website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the
          updated policy.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy, please contact us below.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="privacy-cta">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Need to reach us?</h2>
        <p>
          You can contact our team with questions about scheduling, policies,
          or services. We're here to help.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-outline btn-outline--counseling">
          Contact us
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .privacy-page {
      background: #f9fafb;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .subpage-hero {
      padding: 10rem 1.5rem 3rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .subpage-hero h1 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .subpage-hero p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Shared section wrapper ───────────────────────── */
    .section-inner {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ── Body ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .privacy-body {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.2rem;
      background-color: #e5e9f3;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .policy-effective {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin: 0 0 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .privacy-body h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .privacy-body h2:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .privacy-body p {
      margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .privacy-body ul {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .privacy-body li + li {
      margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }

    .privacy-body a {
      color: #7d6fb3;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* ── CTA ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .privacy-cta {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .privacy-cta h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .privacy-cta p {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Outline button ───────────────────────────────── */
    .btn-outline {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease,
        box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling {
      border-color: #7d6fb3;
      color: #7d6fb3;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling:hover {
      background: #7d6fb3;
      color: #ffffff;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(125, 111, 179, 0.3);
    }
  </style>
</Layout>